1. Project Overview

This section explains what your application does.

Your system is a college attendance application where:

Teachers mark attendance for students.

Students view their attendance.

Attendance is organized by Lecture 1, Lecture 2, Lecture 3, etc.

The backend stores attendance in MySQL.

Example:

A teacher marks Sahil as Present in Lecture 1. The system saves the record in the database, and Sahil can later view it from his dashboard.

